# ===== @ludo/client — online play (Sprint 2) =====
# WebSocket endpoint of the game server (@ludo/server, GAME_PORT).
# Defaults when unset: ws://localhost:8107 in dev · same-origin wss:// in prod builds
# (see client/src/game/net/config.ts). Set this explicitly if the game server
# lives on a different host/port than the one serving the client, e.g.:
# VITE_GAME_WS=wss://yourdomain.com
# VITE_GAME_WS=ws://localhost:8107
